#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Sakan-dalana:</strong> Apetraho ny fahafahana ampiasaina hikajiana ny taham-pampiasana, ohatra 100M na 1G. Tohanana ny K, M, G ary T. Fidio ny Mitovy amin'ny &quot;Miditra&quot; rehefa mitovy ny fahafahana amin'ny lalana roa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Fifandraisana fifamoivoizana:</strong> Mikaroha araka ny fitaovana, seranana na famaritana, na safidio ny Jereo daholo. Fidio ny fifandraisana iray, avy eo tsindrio ny Ampiasao ny fifandraisana hametrahana ny loharano refesina fototra, ny toerana aleha rehefa tsindriana ary ny kisary fototra miseho rehefa lalovana. Tazomina ny loharano refesina fanampiny sy ny kisary miseho rehefa lalovana.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Endrika ivelany sy fanamarihana:</strong> Ny Endriky ny Fiviliana no mifehy ny fiolahana miolaka na misy zoro; ny Sakan'ny Rohy no mifehy ny hatevin'ny zana-tsipìka. Ny Fanamarihana MIDITRA sy Fanamarihana MIVOAKA dia manampy lahatsoratra manaraka ny lalana tsirairay. Ny isan-jato no mametraka ny toeran'ny lahatsoratra manaraka ny rohy. Ny Endrika Fanamarihana dia mametraka fanamarihana eo akaikin'ny rohy (Sisiny) na eo ambonin'ny zana-tsipìka (Afovoany); ny Ampiasao ny voafaritra mialoha amin'ny sarintany dia manaraka ny Endriky ny Sarintany.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Kisary fanampiny miseho rehefa lalovana:</strong> Maneho kisary roa farafahabetsany rehefa lalovana: ny kisary fifamoivoizana fototra ary iray fanampiny, toy ny CPU, fahatarana na fifandraisana hafa. Ny Sivano araka ny karazana kisary dia mametra ny safidy. Ny Manampy kisary miseho rehefa lalovana dia manampy ilay fanampiny; ny Soloy ny kisary miseho rehefa lalovana dia manova azy; ny Esory ny kisary dia manala azy. Tsy miova ny kisary fifamoivoizana fototra, ny fifamoivoizana refesina ary ny toerana aleha rehefa tsindriana ny rohy. Ao amin'ny mpijery, ny topimaso Cacti tsirairay dia manokatra ny kisary fenony manokana rehefa tsindriana.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Fandrindrana mandroso:</strong> Fanaraha-maso tsy voatery hamindrana ny mariky ny fifamoivoizana MIDITRA/MIVOAKA, hanambarana loharano refesina, hanovana ny toerana aleha rehefa tsindriana ary hampidirana URL sary manokana miseho rehefa lalovana. Ny toeran'ny mariky ny fifamoivoizana dia mamindra ny boaty taham-pampiasana manaraka ny rohy, tsy miankina amin'ny toeran'ny fanamarihana. Ny Ampiasao ny voafaritra mialoha amin'ny sarintany dia manaraka ny Endriky ny Sarintany. Ny rohy fifamoivoizana mahazatra dia matetika tsy mila fanovana eto.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Fanambarana loharanom-pifamoivoizana:</strong> Ny Manampy loharanom-pifamoivoizana dia manampy fifandraisana hafa ao amin'ny totalin'ny sarintany, misaraka ho an'ny MIDITRA sy MIVOAKA. Ny Esory ny loharano dia manala loharano fanampiny. Ovao ny loharano fototra amin'ny alalan'ny Ampiasao ny fifandraisana etsy ambony. Ampitahaina amin'ny sakan-dalana voaomana ny fifamoivoizana natambatra mba hikajiana ny taham-pampiasana. Tsy misy kisary Cacti natambatra foronina mandeha ho azy; mamorona kisary mitambatra mifanaraka ao amin'ny Cacti ary ampidiro ny URL tsindriana sy lalovana raha ilaina. Matetika mazava kokoa ny rohy sarintany misaraka ho an'ny fifandraisana fototra sy tahiry.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Loharano sy URL ampidirina tanana:</strong> Ny boaty lahatsoratra loharano dia manova ny lisitra feno an'ny loharano refesina, tafiditra ao ny loharano fototra. Ny URL toerana aleha rehefa tsindriana no mifehy izay aleha rehefa tsindriana ny rohy sarintany. Ny URL kisary fototra miseho rehefa lalovana no mametraka ny topimaso voalohany; ny URL kisary fanampiny dia manaiky URL sary fanampiny iray. Tantanina ao amin'ny Kisary fanampiny miseho rehefa lalovana koa ity fanampiny ity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Alamino sy Fiviliana:</strong> Ny Alamino dia manitsy ny fandaminana ny rohy. Ny Fiviliana dia ahafahanao mametraka teboka fiolahana eo amin'ny sarintany.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ovao ny Fikirakirana Manta:</strong> Ovao ny rafitra soratry ny sarintany ambany ho an'ny fandrindrana mihoatra ity taratasy fenoina ity.</p>"

